{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_20","type":"agent_message","text":"The mark is stored in the persistent heap entry, and the shared effect handler should give all VM lanes the same mutation behavior. The key question is mint authority: the new mint is exported by the ordinary cell module, so I’m testing whether the compiler’s spelling check actually keeps guests from calling it."}}
